// ── The Kakery (2×2) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// A cake shop wearing its product: a pink storefront whose roof is a giant
// three-tier birthday cake with dripping frosting, flickering candles and a
// cherry. The display window holds a wedding cake, a chocolate drip cake and
