// ── Pharma Lab (6×6) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// A pharmaceutical research campus that follows the sulfur chain. The main
// lab's glass front opens onto a clean room — technicians in white suits at
// stainless bioreactors, a robot arm pipetting, sample racks glowing teal —
// under a roof of HEPA air handlers. Beside it, a frosted cold-store wing
// with humming condensers, a -80°C readout and a reefer truck that backs up
// to the dock; a vapour-venting liquid-nitrogen tank; a medicinal-plant
