// ── Isotope Research Lab (8×6) ───────────────────────────────────────────
// A secure nuclear-medicine campus that arrives once the fuel chain has made
// rods. With the roofs cut away: a cyclotron whose beam races round its
// magnet ring and out down a beamline to the target station; a research pool
// glowing Cherenkov blue over its core, with a bridge crane tracking across;
// and a row of hot cells where manipulator arms handle glowing vials behind
// lead glass. Outside, a double fence with a guard post, a radiation monitor
// reading out dose, hazmat-suited staff, and a shielded cask truck that
