// ── The Blue Note (3×2) ──
// A basement jazz bar in a narrow indigo-brick townhouse. Open 20:00–02:00
// (DemandCurves.jazzbar / HOURS). Open: the arched window glows amber on a
// trio in silhouette (piano, double bass, a saxophone that catches the
// spot) over the heads of the house, notes drift out over the pavement, the
// blue script sign and the JAZZ blade are lit, a doorman minds the red door
