// ── Pulse (7×5) ──
// The superclub: a concrete box wrapped in LED. Open 22:00–05:00
// (DemandCurves.superclub / HOURS). Open: the whole front is a screen
// running a heartbeat trace under the word PULSE, which kicks with the
// beat; LED fins on both wings fill like meters; a crown of lasers fans off
// a ring truss on the roof and four sky-trackers sweep; the roof terrace
// has a lit pool, loungers, palms and festoon lights; below, a long roped
