// ── MK2 properties with a load shape of their own ────────────────────────
// Glasswing Nursery (grow lamps that come on when the sun doesn't),
// Emberstone Hot Springs (an evening crowd on geothermal ground) and
// Saltwind Cannery (flat out every third day, near idle between).
// _nKit units (40 per tile); no backdrop.

// ── Glasswing Nursery (6×4, commercial) ──
